- Accepted: ${promptRun.acceptedCandidates.length}/${promptRun.exploredCandidates.length} candidates${nodePodNote}

**Weaknesses diagnosed:** ${diagnoseBenchmark(baseline).map((s) => s.area).join(", ") || "none"}`;
